# Local Grove state — `grove run` writes timestamped scratch projects
# under <monorepo>/.grove/run/, and the release script writes a
# `.release-in-progress` lock file at the repo root. None of this
# should be committed. (Audit finding #10.)
.grove/
.worktrees/
.release-in-progress

# Local scaffold smoke tests — never commit a `grove new` scratch site.
examples/*/
.audit/